#: healthcare/healthcare/doctype/clinical_procedure/clinical_procedure.js:456
msgid "The selected Clinical Procedure Template does not have any consumables configured."
msgstr "لا يحتوي قالب الإجراء السريري المحدد على أي مستهلكات مُعدة."

#: healthcare/healthcare/doctype/inpatient_record/inpatient_record.py:615
